screen.SHADOWS=Direct Lighting
screen.SHADOWS.comment=Light that comes straight from the sun and moon, and the shadows it casts.
option.SHADOW_COLOR=Colored Shadows
option.SHADOW_COLOR.comment=Sunlight passing through stained glass and other see-through blocks takes on their color.
option.SCREEN_SPACE_SHADOWS=Contact Shadows
option.SCREEN_SPACE_SHADOWS.comment=Adds small, sharp shadows where objects meet surfaces, which the shadow map is too coarse to show. §c[-]§r Slightly decreases performance.
option.VPS=Soft Shadows
option.VPS.comment=Shadows get softer the farther they fall from the object casting them, as real sunlight does.
option.VPS_BLUR_STRENGTH=Shadow Softness
option.VPS_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=How quickly soft shadows blur with distance from the object casting them.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Sharpness of sun and moon shadows. §c[-]§r Higher values decrease performance.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How many blocks from you shadows are drawn. The same resolution covers a larger area, so higher values also make shadows blurrier. §c[-]§r Higher values decrease performance.
option.SHADOW_FILTER_SAMPLES=Shadow Filter Quality
option.SHADOW_FILTER_SAMPLES.comment=How many samples smooth the edges of shadows. §c[-]§r High decreases performance.
value.SHADOW_FILTER_SAMPLES.6=Normal
value.SHADOW_FILTER_SAMPLES.8=High
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilts the path of the sun and moon across the sky, which changes the direction shadows fall.
suffix.sunPathRotation=°

